iming: 30 minutes after abandonment<br>EVENT: BOOKING PAGE ABANDONMENT (visited booking page, left without booking)<br>  Response: What is holding you back? One reply gets you the answer. + rep alert<br>  Timing: within 5 minutes of page exit<br>EVENT: REFERRAL RECEIVED (new lead enters with referral source tag)<br>  Response: immediate personalized welcome + fast-track to booking<br>  Timing: within 60 seconds of entry<br>CAPTURE WINDOW: All event responses fire within 60 seconds to 5 minutes<br>If booking does not occur within 4 hours: resume drip sequence<br>PRINCIPLE: Momentum is perishable. Curiosity and desire decay rapidly without action.<br>The system does not log intent. It INTERRUPTS and CONVERTS.<br>DESIGN PRINCIPLE: Every touchpoint is dual-track:<br>Track 1: Continue the designed sequence (trust building)<br>Track 2: Offer an immediate booking path (momentum capture)<br>Both always present. Never optional.<br>BOOKING ESCAPE HATCH: Every email in S2.0-S3.x includes persistent booking link<br>P.S. or footer: Ready now? Skip ahead and book: [link]<br>If clicked: exit sequence, apply tags, route to S4.2 directly"]
